{
  "_comment": "Tracks the npm-published version each vendored library under annuaire/static/vendor/ was last synced from, and which package files map to which local files. Read/written by `manage.py upgrade_vendored_assets` -- see that command's docstring and docs/deployment.md's 'Automated dependency upgrades' section. Do not hand-edit the \"version\" fields; the command owns them.",
